#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "If you insist, yeah, we could team up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, bringing your own people in is reasonable.  Still, the more the better."
"  It's my uncle in there, I'm more than willing to help out.  I know my way "
"around, I won't get in your way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"All right.  As long as you follow my lead, we could use another pair of "
"hands."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It's all right.  We've got this, you get things ready for when we return with"
" Barry."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*nods.  \"I'm fine following your lead.  I'm a good scout and hunter, but "
"I've never done anything like this before.  When you set the time, I'll head "
"out and wait near the scout tower for you with the best gear I can get.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "All right.  Let's kick some alien butt."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Is there anyone else around here that could help us?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"You mentioned that Carlos, Eddie and Luke probably can't help in a firefight."
"  Is there any other way we could use them?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Like I said, I don't really think my dad or uncle should help, and I think "
"Luke's more likely to get injured than be helpful."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "What about Lisa?  She seems like she could handle herself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Well, I guess it's just us.  <lets_go>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*blinks.  \"My… yeah, of course Lisa could come.  Damn, she'd smack me if she"
" knew I didn't think of that myself.  Mind if I go talk to her about it?  "
"I'll get her to come out with me and we'll meet you together, if she's "
"willing.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Okay, I'll give you about an hour to talk with her about it.  I'll be back "
"soon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Probably.  They'd want to, for sure.\"  He looks thoughtful.  \"I'm sure we "
"could use more help, but this isn't my strong suit.  Let me think about it.  "
"If you have any ideas, run them by me.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "OK.  Let's talk about it again in a bit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah.  I think they should cover our exit.  We've got an old truck they could"
" set up as a platform, where Dad can put down covering fire without his knee "
"being an issue.  Eddie can drive, instead of shoot, and Luke or Mom can be "
"ready with some first aid supplies.  Then when we get out, we've got an easy "
"getaway set up, and there's less chance of us getting flanked while we're in "
"there looking for Barry.\"  He looks at you, suddenly nervous.  \"Is that a "
"good plan?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Seems like a good plan to me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I think it's better we take my vehicle, and just leave them out of it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I don't think one farmer with a hunting rifle is going to be enough to keep "
"our backs safe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I think we need some kind of secure fallback point for the family, maybe a "
"defensive wall?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We're going to need some way to breach the tower itself, possibly some form "
"of explosives.  Do you know anyone who could help us with that?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*looks crestfallen for a moment, then straightens up.  \"All right.  Yeah, "
"maybe better not to put them at risk I guess.  So we're back to going in "
"without them.  Maybe that's better, I don't want to lose anyone else.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Can you think of anything else we might need, or should we put this into "
"action?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Let's go get your uncle back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I've changed my mind.  I think it's better we take my vehicle, and just leave"
" them out of it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I'm a bit worried about defenses.  Do you folks have any armor or equipment "
"to help keep yourselves safe?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*looks thoughtful.  \"Well, we can wear our usual wrangling gear, but you're "
"right.  It's no good against those claws.\"  He sighs.  \"I don't want to "
"delay, but I don't want to lose another family member either.  If we could "
"get our hands on some riot gear, that might give us a better chance to fend "
"off the monsters.  Not too far away, our corrupt-as-hell local cops kept "
"enough of that gear on hand to easily set our family up.  As if they needed "
"it in this place.  Just used it to keep the boot on, y'know?\"  He spits on "
"the ground.  \"I can show you where their stores were, it'd feel nice to put "
"that stuff to good use.  Of course, any riot gear would do, if you happen to "
"have already looted some.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I think you're right, that would take too long.  We'll have to count on "
"offense being our best defense."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Show me where, and I'll try to get some riot gear for you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*smiles slightly.  \"Awesome, getting our team kitted out better will go a "
"long way to making this possible.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "[5 Riot Armor] I've got enough riot armor for everyone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "[5 Riot Helmet] These crowd control helmets should help a lot."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"[5 Riot Arm Guard] I hope these armguards won't interfere with people's aim."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"[5 Riot Leg Guard] I've got these leg guards to keep people from getting "
"hobbled."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"We have enough full sets of riot control armor to cover everyone, head to "
"toe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*nods intently, looking at the assembled pile of equipment.  \"Like I said, "
"I'll get this distributed to everyone who's coming.  It's starting to feel "
"more real, but less impossible.  Thanks for doing this.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Before you get on to that, I wanted to talk about something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'll let you get on that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*nods slowly.  \"I understand.  You tried.  We could maybe… no, nevermind.  "
"Time is important here, we can't spend forever hoping to get everything in "
"place if we want to get Uncle Barry back alive.  Let's do it without the "
"gear.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*nods slowly.  \"I understand.  You tried.  We could maybe… no, nevermind.  "
"Time is important here, we can't spend forever hoping to get everything in "
"place if we want to get Uncle Barry back alive.  Let's do it without the "
"gear.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*nods slowly.  \"I understand.  You tried.  We could maybe… no, nevermind.  "
"Time is important here, we can't spend forever hoping to get everything in "
"place if we want to get Uncle Barry back alive.  Let's do it without the "
"gear.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sorry.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm sorry.  I'm going to go take care of a few more things."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Good idea.  A sandbag wall would be easy enough, we've had to do those a few "
"times when we've had flooding and everyone knows the drill.  Back then we "
"just grabbed supplies from the hardware store, though.  Maybe you'd be able "
"to make a run for those?  Something like 20 canvas bags would probably do it."
"  We can fill them up in advance and toss them out of the truck to get a "
"decent barricade."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I think this is going to take too long, honestly.  Let's just stick with the "
"truck."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I know where to find those canvas bags, I'll go get them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"All right.  I think that's everything we need.  Let me get it out to the "
"family and we'll have it all prepped by tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Before I go, let's talk about something else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'll let you get on that, I've got my own preparations to take care of."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"* looks thoughtful for a moment, then becomes a bit nervous.  \"Wait, won't "
"that run the risk of injuring Barry, or possibly collapsing the tower?  I "
"don't want him hurt during this, or anyone else if this bomb sends back a "
"bunch of shrapnel.  What do you think about it?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Don't worry, I know what I'm doing.  I've taken a look at these sorts of "
"towers before, and I know that the structure itself is pretty solid.  If we "
"tune it right, then the tower won't fall over."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, I trust you on this.  If you need a good hand with chemistry, go see "
"Luke about it.  He knows a lot, you'd be surprised.  \" He pauses for a "
"moment, and thinks as if trying to recall something.  \"Luke should be over "
"in the old outbuilding near the dairy, that's on the other end of the "
"property."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"That sounds great, I'll go talk to him about it.  Let's talk about something "
"else first, though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "That sounds great, I'll go talk to him about it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"If you think we're ready, I think we can try another go.  Even… even if it's "
"too late for Uncle Barry, I think we've got to try to take that damn tower "
"out of commission."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Retrieve 5 sets of riot armor for the Isherwoods"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Retrieve Canvas Bags for Chris"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, when would more of this stuff be ready?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Around <interval>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Claire_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Alright then, bye."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "When will your cows produce again?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*is a sun-worn, middle-aged man with crows feet and graying hair.  He looks "
"up as you approach, "
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"then sneers as he spots the Old Guard Marshal badge gleaming on your chest.  "
"\"I already told your kind not to come around here.  You need to keep on "
"walking, straight off this property.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"then gives you a little greeting wave.  \"Hello Sir, what brings you here?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"then gives you a little greeting wave.  \"Hello Ma'am, what brings you "
"here?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Luke said you guys have some issues with the Old Guard.  What's up with that?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "*glares at your marshal badge.  \"I said, keep *walking*, G-man.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*spits on the ground, glancing at where your marshal badge would have been, "
"and shaking his head.  \"Nice try.  You can take off the badge, but I know "
"what you are, I'm not some country rube.  Get out.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"<color_green>[Social 3]</color> I swear, I'm not here to cause trouble.  I "
"just volunteer with those guys to help travelers, things like that.  I don't "
"speak for them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"<color_yellow>[Social <3]</color> I took it off man, what more do you want "
"from me?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Fine, I'm gone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", looking at your marshal badge immediately.  \"Nope.  Agreement or not, I'm "
"not talking to you while you're wearing their sign, and I don't appreciate "
"the disrespect.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", his eyes darting to the spot where your marshal badge would be.  \"What "
"now?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "What's the deal with you and the Old Guard, anyway?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*spits on the ground.  \"Didn't much care for the government and the cops "
"before everything happened, care for them quite a bit less now.  We've had a "
"run-in or two with the folks calling themselves the 'Old Guard'.  That's all "
"I care to say about it.  They'll never be welcome on my land and I don't "
"believe for a second that they didn't cause all this in the first place.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks for telling me.  <end_talking_bye>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*grimaces.  \"Fine, I'll give you a chance, but you don't mess with me or my "
"family, you understand?  This is our land, not yours.  Or theirs.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks for hearing me out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'll give you space for now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "I feel like maybe you didn't hear me right.  Get.  Off.  My.  Land."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "You can't make me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "If the cows don't get anything nasty it should be around <interval>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Cheers, bye."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*speaks in a quiet monotone, like he's reading off a page.  \"Barry and "
"Carlos went to hunt down something that killed our livestock, they tracked it"
" into the forest.  It grabbed Barry and ran off, you might be able to get "
"Carlos to tell you the story, if he can bring himself to share what "
"happened.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm not interested right now.  <end_talking_leave>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "Gather 100 units of clay"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 100 units of clay"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Now that the clay kiln is set up, we could use 100 units of clay to get "
"production going."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
msgid "Find 10 3 L jars"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jesse_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hello.  We don't see many people these days."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I talked to Chris about rescuing Barry.  He thinks you might be able to help."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"My family owns all the land around here, my parents are out in the barn and "
"my other family is down the road."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, he's supposed to be hunting, but since you've been talking to Luke, I "
"bet he mentioned Chris wants to learn more about the end of the world.  "
"Sometimes he'll take off for a few days and I end up patching him up so my "
"parents don't know he left the property."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, Chris talked to me a minute ago.\"  She touches the shoulder strap on "
"her rifle.  \"I can't believe he's not trying to talk me out of it, really, "
"but I'd do anything to save Uncle Barry.  I'll be ready at the tower, when "
"you need me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "Great.  I'll see you there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"He did?\"  She touches the shoulder strap on her rifle.  \"Like, action?  "
"Yeah, I'm a pretty good shot, and I'd do anything to save Uncle Barry.  I'm "
"surprised Chris didn't try to go all protective older brother on me.  What's "
"the plan?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid "[Explain the plan.]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Lisa_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"&She listens intently as you explain.  \"All right.  I'll be ready at the "
"tower when you need me.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*is a young man in his mid teens, wearing threadbare but clean work trousers "
"and a plain shirt with a few holes in it.  He looks you up and down as you "
"approach"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", then scowls as he spots the Old Guard Marshal badge gleaming on your chest."
"  \"I see that badge.  You should leave before my father spots it.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", and nods once when he sees you've taken off your marshal badge.  \"Tread "
"carefully around here, we don't have a lot of respect for your type of "
"lawman.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ", then raises a hand to greet you.  \"Hello.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", then raises his hand to his forehead in an old fashioned hat-tipping sort "
"of gesture.  \"Hello.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "What's wrong with me being a marshal?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "How are those books doing for you?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris and I have a little project for you that we've cooked up, if you're "
"interested."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "We've got the truck, what's next?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I've got the dynamite you requested, I can't wait to see how this works out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, what are you doing out here?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I don't see how it's much of your business what our story is.  You can try "
"asking my dad, Eddie, if you really want.  Just don't start acting like some "
"little piece of tin in your pocket means you can come in like you own the "
"place."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Maybe I can help out.  What do you need?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*gestures to where they sit on a shelf.  \"I've been trying to look at them, "
"but I can't focus too much right now.\"  He smiles sadly.  \"Hope to get to "
"them soon.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Because of Barry?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*winces a little at the name.  \"Yeah.  Because of Barry.\"  You can see he'd"
" rather not pursue the topic."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*smiles.  \"Bit early to tell, but I've been doing some night time reading "
"and trying a few things out.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*smiles brightly.  \"Real great, thanks!  I've learned a lot from them "
"already.  Tried my hand at some basic stuff, it's fun to learn new things.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*gestures around at the worn down shed surrounding you.  \"I've been cleaning"
" up this old building to make it into a workshop.  I want to put up a pottery"
" kiln and forge.  My dad doesn't want me leaving the farm to find some things"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", says it is too dangerous.  After what happened with Barry, well, I tend to "
"agree with him.\"  He smiles thinly.  \"Don't want you to have to run out "
"saving another one of us, right?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", says it's too dangerous.  I used to think he was being a pain in the butt, "
"but lately…\" he stops abruptly, and says nothing more."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I know all the grown-ups worry about us, but I think we can adapt better than"
" them in the long run.  Chris - my cousin - has some interesting thoughts on "
"the matter."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"&His shoulders slump a little at the question.  \"Things have been tough for "
"my dad since Barry was captured.  He works till he falls asleep most "
"nights…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*looks around, then leans in just a little closer.  \"He's doing OK now that "
"Barry's home, but, well, things still aren't the same.  I imagine that'll "
"take time.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*goes a bit pale.  \"I shouldn't have said that.  Not my place to talk to a "
"stranger about it.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I already know Barry got captured.  I just wanted to know a bit more about "
"it.  Maybe I can help."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I might be able to help, though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*frowns.  \"I don't know how much I can tell you.  Your best bet is to talk "
"to Uncle Carlos.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I really… okay.  Maybe ask my grandma, Claire.  She'll know if it's okay to "
"talk about."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, he doesn't agree that what we're doing here will last.  He thinks "
"things will only get worse.\"  Luke shrugs, as if to say he doesn't have a "
"strong opinion on the matter.  \"It's tough to get the adults to listen "
"though, much less agree with his solution.  You can go talk to him more about"
" it if you want."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "How does this all come together?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, we are going to turn this truck into a bomb that'll give us a big "
"enough opening in the tower to let out some of the heat and gas.  But small "
"enough that it won't kill Barry unless it's right next to him."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Are you serious?  This is your brother we are risking here!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Exactly, and I wouldn't do anything to risk him unnecessarily."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"OK so I have an idea on how we can breach that tower.  We need a truck and "
"some dynamite.  I've heard about some bandits in a truck robbing people "
"nearby.  If you can take care of the bandits I'll pick up the truck later"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "I think I can manage two bandits."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Surely we can think of a better way in."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"So now that we've got the truck we need the boom.  See if you can find some "
"dynamite at the old mines?  Once we got the dynamite I'll rig that up to a "
"kitchen timer and we'll have a bomb on wheels.  I'll need 50lbs to light that"
" truck up like the 4th of July!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "This is gonna rad as heck as long as it works."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Not doing it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I've got everything I need to make this breaching truck for us.  Thanks!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "[heck yeah]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Retrieve the Truck for Luke Isherwood"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Retrieve the Truck for Luke Isherwood"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Kill the two bandits for Luke Isherwood to get their truck."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid "Retrieve Some Dynamite for Luke"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Retrieve Some Dynamite for Luke"
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Luke_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Get 50 pounds of dynamite for Luke Isherwood to make a bomb.  There's a known"
" shipment at a mine in the region."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, fuck you, <name_b>!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Do I need to repeat myself?  Get outta here, <name_b>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Yeah, I got it.  <end_talking_bye>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Do I have a <freaking> exclamation sign over my <freaking> head, like I'm a "
"<freaking> quest-giver from some <freaking> video game?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Are you deaf or stupid?  I said I don't give a fuck for you and your "
"<freaking> problems.  Bother me one more time, and you'll regret that.  Get "
"outta my sight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Are you deaf or stupid?  I said I don't give a fuck for you and your "
"<freaking> problems.  Bother me one more time, and you'll regret that.  Get "
"outta my sight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Are you deaf or stupid?  I said I don't give a fuck for you and your "
"<freaking> problems.  Bother me one more time, and you'll regret that.  Get "
"outta my sight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Disappear, <name_b>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "I have nothing more to say to you.  Get the fuck out of here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"[CANNIBAL] It's hard to die of hunger when there's so many tasty corpses "
"lying around."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"I want to get out of this <freaking> prison.  I hoped you could help me with "
"that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Wait, what?  A <freaking> can of beans?!  I went through hell to get this "
"<freaking> thing for you, and all you give me as reward is a <freaking> can "
"of beans?!  I demand something more substantial."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"Shit!  Looks like I'm on my own now.  Thanks for nothing.  <end_talking_bye>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "You know, I think I'll manage without your help.  <end_talking_bye>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "[Show the military ID card.] You mean this stuff?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Let's say that's none of your <freaking> business.  Other questions?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, where did you get it?  Nevermind, just give it to me.  Right now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Noted.  <end_talking_bye>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid ""
"I'm afraid you're not in the position to demand anything from me, <name_b>.  "
"You're done here, leave."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/island_prison/prisoners.json
msgid "Hey, fuck you, <name_b>!  You'll regret that!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Could you make me a weapon?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "How is my weapon coming?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Interesting.  When would be the next batch of merchandise ready?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "I heard you might want some metal…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "With how the things are goin'? <interval>."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "I'll leave you to your work then.  <end_talking_bye>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"[INT 8] Still this is a lot of equipment.  Wouldn't it have been easier to "
"buy this stuff from a manufacturer?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"There yah go, one co-op membership with your name on it.  Shop's in the back,"
" keep it tidy and share if anyone else is around workin'.  Just as a heads-"
"up, you'll need to bring your own charcoal.  There's a kiln in there too, so "
"if you got things to burn, just throw 'em in there and light up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "[PER 8] Is that why you don't carry any cash?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Sure, honey!  I'm always in need of more material!  What's the price, though?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
msgid "Well, how about 100 merch for every 70 pounds of metal…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you did for me, I'd equip an army for you.  I'll need some "
"money to negotiate with the caravans and scavengers that come by.  What level"
" of protection are you thinking?  I can do 2mm, 4mm, and 6mm suits depending "
"on how much you want to resemble a tank, or I can make you a suit of "
"chainmail instead if you want a little more flexibility.  Materials costs are"
" 300 merch to pay for the food I need to do the labor plus 100 merch per 2mm "
"or 50 merch for the chainmail.  Whatever I save in non-scaling bits like the "
"chain and leather, I get gouged in looking for so much bulk metal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you did for me, I'd equip an army for you.  I'll need some "
"money to negotiate with the caravans and scavengers that come by.  What level"
" of protection are you thinking?  I can do 2mm, 4mm, and 6mm suits depending "
"on how much you want to resemble a tank, or I can make you a suit of "
"chainmail instead if you want a little more flexibility.  Materials costs are"
" 300 merch to pay for the food I need to do the labor plus 100 merch per 2mm "
"or 50 merch for the chainmail.  Whatever I save in non-scaling bits like the "
"chain and leather, I get gouged in looking for so much bulk metal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you did for me, I'd equip an army for you.  I'll need some "
"money to negotiate with the caravans and scavengers that come by.  What level"
" of protection are you thinking?  I can do 2mm, 4mm, and 6mm suits depending "
"on how much you want to resemble a tank, or I can make you a suit of "
"chainmail instead if you want a little more flexibility.  Materials costs are"
" 300 merch to pay for the food I need to do the labor plus 100 merch per 2mm "
"or 50 merch for the chainmail.  Whatever I save in non-scaling bits like the "
"chain and leather, I get gouged in looking for so much bulk metal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "[350 merch, 1.2mm] I'd prefer to just have chainmail."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "[400 merch, 2mm] I like to stay light."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "[500 merch, 4mm] A middle ground would be good."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "[600 merch, 6mm] Never skimp on protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"  For five I could, I think, create a suit of that nomad armor.  It would "
"incorporate climate control, help you support more weight, and it'll have a "
"jumpsuit built in, but you won't be able to wear normal clothes with it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid "[3 weeks, great protection] High steel sounds great."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"Alright, so it'll be <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_thickness>mm armor "
"made of the best high steel a woman can scavenge.  If you're good with that, "
"I'll take the merch up front and we can start taking some very invasive "
"measurements."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
msgid ""
"[<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_armor_cost> merch] Sounds good.  See you "
"in <u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_wait> weeks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "Um… wait, I don't have that kind of money right now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"The Pressin was a self defense weapon for politicians in Spain.  It was a "
"small breach loaded handheld pistol that could fit in a glasses case and be "
"fired subtly.  I figure that we can improve on the design by adding a "
"retracting blade while keeping the surprise shots.  To get this working I'm "
"gonna need a .32 gun like a Kel-Tec P-32, or a Walther PPK.  I'll also need a"
" switchblade, 20 merch, and a week."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you've done for me, I'll forge you the finest work of art.  The price and waiting time depend on the size of the weapon in question, but it will take me a fair amount of money to buy the quality steel I need from the scavengers, and even forging a short blade will take a few days.\n"
"\n"
"I can also temper your weapon, but that will cost an additional 50 merch and take an additional 2 days, but I assure you, it's worth it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Sure.  After what you've done for me, I'll forge you the finest work of art.  The price and waiting time depend on the size of the weapon in question, but it will take me a fair amount of money to buy the quality steel I need from the scavengers, and even forging a short blade will take a few days.\n"
"\n"
"I can also temper your weapon, but that will cost an additional 50 merch and take an additional 2 days, but I assure you, it's worth it."
msgstr ""

